\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Soldiers of Christ, arise,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0  And put your armour on,
\par  Strong in the strength which God supplies
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Through His eternal  Son,
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. Strong in the Lord of Hosts,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And in His mighty power,
\par Who in the strength of Jesus trusts
\par \cf1 Is more than conqueror.
\par \cf0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Stand then in His great might,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 With all His strength endued,
\par But take, to arm you for the fight,
\par The panoply of God,
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4. Stand then against your foes,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 In close and firm array,
\par   Legions of wily fiends oppose
\par Throughout the evil day.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5. But meet the sons of night,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 But mock their vain design,
\par Armed in the arms of  heavenly light,
\par Of righteousness divine.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.  Leave no unguarded place,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 No weakness of the soul,
\par Take every virtue, every grace,
\par And fortify the whole.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.  Indissolubly joined,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 To battle all proceed;
\par  But arm yourselves with all the mind
\par \pard       That was in Christ, your Head.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

